### ShoppingList nach ID
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist/4

###

### Items einer ShoppingList
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist/4/items

###

### Item erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/item
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shampoo",
  "category": "Drogerie",
  "amount": "1 Stück",
  "shop": "DM",
  "url": "",
  "price": 2.99,
  "priority": "mittel",
  "status": "Zu kaufen",
  "purchased": false,
  "shoppingList": {
    "id": 4
  }
}
###

### Alle geteilten Listen
GET http://localhost:8080/shared-shoppinglists

###

### User erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "auth0|testuser1",
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "name": "Test User 1"
}
###

### ShoppingList mit User teilen
POST http://localhost:8080/shared-shoppinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shoppingList": {
    "id": 4
  },
  "user": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser1"
  }
}
###

### Alle geteilten Listen
GET http://localhost:8080/shared-shoppinglists

### Geteilte Listen von User
GET http://localhost:8080/shared-shoppinglists/user/auth0%7Ctestuser1

### Zweiten User erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "auth0|testuser2",
  "email": "test2@example.com",
  "name": "Test User 2"
}

###

### Freundschaftsanfrage erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/friendships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser1"
  },
  "friend": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser2"
  }
}

###

### Alle Freundschaften
GET http://localhost:8080/friendships

### Freundschaft annehmen
PUT http://localhost:8080/friendships/1/accept

###

### Freundschaft ablehnen
PUT http://localhost:8080/friendships/1/decline

### Neue Freundschaftsanfrage
POST http://localhost:8080/friendships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser1"
  },
  "friend": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser2"
  }
}
### Freundschaft annehmen
PUT http://localhost:8080/friendships/2/accept

### ShoppingList Owner setzen
PUT http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emoji": "cart",
  "name": "DM",
  "category": "Drogerie",
  "owner": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser1"
  }
}
### Alle Freundschaften
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist/4

### ShoppingList mit akzeptiertem Freund teilen
POST http://localhost:8080/shared-shoppinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shoppingList": {
    "id": 4,
    "owner": {
      "id": "auth0|testuser1"
    }
  },
  "user": {
    "id": "auth0|testuser2"
  }
}
### Alle Freundschaften
GET http://localhost:8080/shared-shoppinglists

### Shoppinglist
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
###
POST http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emoji": "🛒",
  "name": "Edeka",
  "category": "Lebensmittel"
}
